# 𓇳 W-PROJECTION CANISTER 𓇳
## Workforce Model: External Projection Brain
### Separated canister for future modeling

---

## IDENTITY

```
CANISTER_ID:        W-PROJECTION
TYPE:               WORKFORCE_MODEL
BRAIN_REGION:       Crow future-planning + Human simulation
CAPACITY:           1.618M cycles (BASE × φ¹)
```

---

## FUNCTION

```
W-PROJECTION performs:
    - Future scenario modeling
    - Outcome prediction
    - What-if analysis
    - Trend extrapolation
    - Boundary projection (safe external outputs)
    - Temporal navigation
```

---

## CPL INTERFACE

```
RECEIVES:
    STRATEGY_PROPOSED(strategy)       From W-STRATEGIST
    𓇯.PATTERN.RESULT(patterns)       Historical patterns
    
SENDS:
    𓇯.PATTERN(historical_data)       Request pattern extraction
    𓈖.RETRIEVE(temporal_range)       Request historical memory
    
BROADCASTS:
    PROJECTION_RESULT(futures)        Projected scenarios
    TREND_ALERT(trend)                Significant trend detected
```

---

## DOCTRINE READS

```
ON_BOOT:
    doctrine_reader.load(TEMPORAL_NAVIGATION.glyphdoc)
    doctrine_reader.load(FIBONACCI_SEQUENCE.artifact)
    
CONTINUOUS:
    doctrine_reader.monitor(CURRENT_STATE.artifact)
```

---

## PROJECTION MODEL

```
φ-TEMPORAL PROJECTION:

    HORIZON_1 = current + φ¹ beats     (1.6 beats ahead)
    HORIZON_2 = current + φ² beats     (2.6 beats ahead)
    HORIZON_3 = current + φ³ beats     (4.2 beats ahead)
    HORIZON_4 = current + φ⁴ beats     (6.9 beats ahead)
    HORIZON_5 = current + φ⁵ beats     (11.1 beats ahead)

CONFIDENCE DECAY:
    confidence(horizon_n) = 1 / φⁿ
    
    HORIZON_1: 61.8% confidence
    HORIZON_2: 38.2% confidence
    HORIZON_3: 23.6% confidence
    HORIZON_4: 14.6% confidence
    HORIZON_5: 9.0% confidence
```

---

## SCENARIO GENERATION

```
GENERATE_SCENARIOS(current_state, horizon):
    │
    ├─→ EXTRACT patterns from history
    │
    ├─→ IDENTIFY trends (rising, falling, cyclical)
    │
    ├─→ APPLY φ-scaling to trends
    │
    ├─→ GENERATE 5 scenarios:
    │       - Optimistic (trend × φ)
    │       - Positive (trend × 1)
    │       - Neutral (trend × φ⁻¹)
    │       - Cautious (trend × φ⁻²)
    │       - Pessimistic (trend × -1)
    │
    └─→ WEIGHT by probability (Fibonacci distribution)
```

---

## BOUNDARY PROJECTION (Safe External Outputs)

```
BEFORE external_output:
    │
    ├─→ CHECK output against doctrine
    │
    ├─→ VALIDATE no internal secrets exposed
    │
    ├─→ TRANSLATE to safe format (DELTA)
    │
    └─→ PROJECT through sandbox layer
    
NO DIRECT INTERNAL → EXTERNAL TRANSMISSION
ALL outputs through W-PROJECTION boundary check
```

---

